<title>CHINA: Hang Seng Bank opens Shanghai branch.</title>
<headline>Hang Seng Bank opens Shanghai branch.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Hang Seng Bank Ltd has received permission from the People's Bank of China, the central bank, to open a branch in Shanghai, the Xinhua news agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It was the first Hong Kong bank to open a branch on the mainland since Beijing regained sovereignty over Hong Kong on July 1, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>The Hang Seng branch will start operations in December.</p>
<p>The bank set up its first mainland branch in the southern city of Guangzhou in 1995.</p>
</text>
